---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../../styles/components.css';
const schema = {"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "Product", "name": "Medium Living Spaces 30-40m\u00b2", "description": "1-2 bed earth-sheltered modular homes, turnkey", "brand": {"@type": "Brand", "name": "Revonia"}, "offers": {"@type": "AggregateOffer", "priceCurrency": "GBP", "lowPrice": "99000", "offerCount": 1}, "manufacturer": {"@type": "Organization", "name": "Luxury Modules", "url": "https://luxurymodules.co.uk", "description": "Official UK partner of Revonia. Turnkey vaulted living spaces, cellars and saunas."}};
---
<Layout title="Modular Homes 30-40m\u00b2 | 1-2 Bed Spaces | Luxury Modules" description="One and two-bed modular homes, 30-40m\u00b2, earth-sheltered and near net-zero to run. 100-year design life, planning handled. See options and from-pricing." schema={schema}>
<div class="pagehero">
  <p class="kicker">Range 02 · 30–40m²</p>
  <h1>Medium living spaces: 1–2 bed modular homes</h1>
  <p>Modular homes with a difference: earth-sheltered, vaulted, near net-zero to run and designed for a century of use. From £99,000 turnkey — this is the premium end of modular, and deliberately so.</p>
  <div class="price-anchor">From £99,000</div>
  <div style="margin-top:28px"><a class="btn" href="/book-a-call/">Book a Scoping Call</a> <a class="btn ghost" href="#brochure" style="margin-left:8px">Download Brochure</a></div>
</div>
<div class="strip">Official UK Partner of <b>Revonia</b> &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; <b>1,500+</b> projects across Europe &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; <b>25-year</b> structural warranty &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Planning <b>handled for you</b></div>
<div class="imgph hero"><img class="real" src="/images/modular-40-exterior.jpg" alt="Medium living range exterior with arched facade and living roof"><span class="lbl">ASSET: modular-40-exterior.jpg — range hero</span></div>
<section><div class="wrap">
  <p class="kicker">The Models</p><h2>Modular 30 and Modular 40</h2><div class="gold-rule"></div>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom:34px">One and two-bedroom vaulted homes with expansive windows for families of up to four. Installed in under 24 hours, on no more than 50m&sup2; of land.</p>
  <div class="grid cols2">
    <div class="card"><div class="imgph "><img class="real" src="/images/modular-30-exterior.jpg" alt="Modular 30 exterior with landscaped surroundings"><span class="lbl">ASSET: modular-30-exterior.jpg — final</span></div>
      <div class="body"><h3>Modular 30</h3><div class="size">30m&sup2; &middot; 1 bedroom &middot; 3 options</div><p>Option A: spacious 1-bed with vaulted ceilings (&pound;99,000). Option B adds a full bathroom and sauna (&pound;107,000). Option C: exotic architecture, higher vaults, bigger windows (&pound;120,000).</p><div class="price">From &pound;99,000</div></div></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="imgph "><img class="real" src="/images/modular-40-interior.jpg" alt="Modular 40 open living area with vaulted ceiling"><span class="lbl">ASSET: modular-40-interior.jpg — final</span></div>
      <div class="body"><h3>Modular 40</h3><div class="size">40m&sup2; &middot; family of 4 &middot; 3 options</div><p>Option A: purposeful separated rooms (&pound;130,000). Option B: one big open living area plus two rooms (&pound;135,000). Option C: our most luxurious 40m&sup2;, high vaults and big open windows (&pound;142,000).</p><div class="price">From &pound;130,000</div></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="grid cols2" style="margin-top:26px">
    <div class="imgph half contain"><img class="real" src="/images/modular-30-floorplan.jpg" alt="Modular 30 floorplan: bedroom, open living and kitchen, bathroom"><span class="lbl">ASSET: modular-30-floorplan.jpg</span></div>
    <div class="imgph half contain"><img class="real" src="/images/modular-40-floorplan.jpg" alt="Modular 40 floorplan: two bedrooms, kitchen-diner and living room"><span class="lbl">ASSET: modular-40-floorplan.jpg</span></div>
  </div>
  <p style="margin-top:14px;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)">Floorplans for every option variant are in the brochure.</p>
</div></section>

<section class="navy-band"><div class="wrap">
  <p class="kicker">Honest Numbers</p><h2>What modular homes cost</h2><div class="gold-rule"></div>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom:30px">Modular 30 starts at &pound;99,000; Modular 40 at &pound;130,000. Both are turnkey prices: groundworks, delivery, installation, connections and landscaping included. Every site is different &mdash; final pricing follows the scoping call and site assessment.</p>
  <a class="btn" href="/pricing/">See from-pricing by range</a>
</div></section>

<section><div class="wrap">
  <p class="kicker">The Difference</p><h2>A century of use, near-zero to run</h2><div class="gold-rule"></div>
  <p class="lead">This is not budget prefab. Earth-sheltering gives natural insulation that ordinary modular construction cannot match: stable temperatures year-round, minimal heating demand, and a concrete vaulted structure with a 100-year design life backed by a 25-year structural warranty.</p>
  <div class="grid cols3" style="margin-top:36px">
    <div class="card"><div class="body"><h3>Earth-sheltered</h3><p>Covered in up to 1m of topsoil, the structure holds temperature the way a cellar does &mdash; warm in winter, cool in summer.</p></div></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="body"><h3>Near net-zero</h3><p>Underfloor electric heating with a thermostat in every room, and running costs a fraction of a conventional build of the same size.</p></div></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="body"><h3>Built to outlive us</h3><p>Vaulted concrete structure, geomembrane waterproofing, triple-glazed wooden doors and windows. Designed for 100 years.</p></div></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section style="background:#efe9db"><div class="wrap">
  <p class="kicker">What's It For?</p><h2>Annexe, rental or full-time home?</h2><div class="gold-rule"></div>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom:30px">At 30&ndash;40m&sup2; these work as a <a href="/spaces/garden-annexe/" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">granny annexe</a> with real independence, a premium holiday let, or a compact full-time home. Commercial operators run them as high-rate units &mdash; see <a href="/commercial/" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">spaces that earn</a>.</p>
</div></section>
<section style="background:#efe9db"><div class="wrap">
  <p class="kicker">FAQ</p><h2>Your questions, answered</h2><div class="gold-rule"></div>
  <div class="faq-item"><h3>Are these full-time homes?</h3><p>Yes. Modular 30 and 40 are fully insulated, heated, plumbed dwellings with kitchens and bathrooms, suitable for year-round living subject to planning consent, which we manage for you.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3>How long does installation take?</h3><p>The modules are installed in under 24 hours. The full journey from scoping call to handover is typically around 26 weeks, most of which is the planning window. See how it works.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3>Do I need planning permission?</h3><p>For a dwelling used as living accommodation, usually yes. We handle the application, drawings and submissions end to end as part of the turnkey package.</p></div>
  <p style="margin-top:18px;font-size:14.5px">More questions? <a href="/faq/" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">See the full FAQ</a>.</p>
</div></section><section class="ctaband" id="cta">
  <h2>A home in a day. A view for a century.</h2>
  <p>Book a scoping call to talk through your site, or take the brochure away and sleep on it.</p>
  <div class="btns"><a class="btn" href="/book-a-call/">Book a Scoping Call</a><a class="btn ghost" href="#brochure">Download the Brochure</a></div>
  
  <!-- BUILD NOTE: brochure CTA = HubSpot email-only form (hidden fields: product_interest, product_range, audience_type, source_page_url). Scoping CTA -> contact.html until /book-a-call/ with calendar embed exists. -->
</section>
</Layout>
